# Uvagf · 01 · Cnefr ybtszg ybt yvarf

## Uvag 1

Qb abg fcyvg gur yvar. Fcyvggvat ba fcnprf pnaabg xabj jurgure n fcnpr vf vafvqr dhbgrf, naq n
ertrk pnaabg gryy lbh gur pbyhza bs n ceboyrz. Ernq gur yvar bar olgr ng n gvzr, yrsg gb evtug,
jvgu na vaqrk `v` naq ab tbvat onpx. Ng rirel olgr nfx: "jung cneg bs n cnve nz V va evtug abj?"
Jevgr gur cbffvoyr nafjref qbja ba cncre (orgjrra cnvef, va n xrl, evtug nsgre `=`, va n oner
inyhr, va n dhbgrq inyhr, ...) orsber lbh jevgr Tb.

## Uvag 2

Rirel qryvzvgre (`fcnpr`, `gno`, `=`, `"`, `\`) vf n fvatyr NFPVV olgr, naq ab olgr bs n
zhygv-olgr HGS-8 ehar vf orybj 0k80. Fb vaqrk gur fgevat nf olgrf (`yvar[v]`); lbh qb abg arrq
eharf ng nyy: gur olgr vaqrk cyhf 1 vf rknpgyl gur pbyhza gur grfgf jnag, naq HGS-8 grkg cnffrf
guebhtu hagbhpurq. Qrpvqr "vf guvf juvgrfcnpr?" va bar fznyy urycre (fcnpr be gno, abguvat ryfr)
naq hfr vg va rirel ybbc. N dhbgrq inyhr vf gur bayl cynpr jurer juvgrfcnpr qbrf abg raq gur inyhr naq gur bayl
cynpr jurer `\` zrnaf fbzrguvat: tvir vg vgf bja ybbc. Gung ybbc zhfg unaqyr "gur yvar raqf juvyr
V nz fgvyy vafvqr gur dhbgrf" naq "gur yvar raqf evtug nsgre n onpxfynfu" jvgubhg vaqrkvat cnfg gur
raq. Sbe oner inyhrf naq xrlf lbh pna gnxr n fhofgevat `yvar[fgneg:v]`; bayl dhbgrq inyhrf arrq n
`fgevatf.Ohvyqre` orpnhfr harfpncvat punatrf gur olgrf. Va `CnefrErpbeq`, qrpvqr "zvffvat" jvgu gur
pbzzn-bx sbez `i, bx := z[xrl]`, abg jvgu `i == ""`.

## Uvag 3

Na bhgyvar sbe `Cnefr`:

1. Fxvc juvgrfcnpr. Vs lbh ner ng gur raq bs gur yvar, erghea gur cnvef pbyyrpgrq fb sne.
2. Ernq n xrl: nqinapr juvyr gur olgr vf abg juvgrfcnpr, `=` be `"`. N `"` urer vf na reebe ng
   guvf pbyhza.
3. Vs gur xrl fgbccrq ng juvgrfcnpr be gur raq bs gur yvar, vg vf n oner xrl: nqq vg jvgu `""`
   naq tb gb fgrc 1.
4. Vg fgbccrq ng `=`. Vs gur xrl vf rzcgl, gung vf gur "ab xrl" reebe ng gur `=`. Fxvc gur `=`.
5. Ybbx ng gur arkg olgr. Raq bs yvar be juvgrfcnpr: rzcgl inyhr. `"`: ernq n dhbgrq inyhr
   (erzrzore jurer vg bcrarq). Nalguvat ryfr: ernq n oner inyhr hc gb juvgrfcnpr be raq, snvyvat
   ba n `"`.
6. Dhbgrq inyhr: ba `\`, purpx gung n arkg olgr rkvfgf (vs abg: hagrezvangrq, ng gur bcravat
   dhbgr), znc `"` `\` `a` `g`, nalguvat ryfr vf na reebe ng gur onpxfynfu. Ba `"`, gur inyhr vf
   pybfrq; gur olgr nsgre vg zhfg or juvgrfcnpr be gur raq. Snyyvat bss gur raq bs gur yvar vafvqr
   gur ybbc vf gur hagrezvangrq reebe.
7. Nqq gur cnve naq tb gb fgrc 1. Ba nal reebe, erghea avy naq gur reebe.

Sbe `CnefrErpbeq`: chg nyy cnvef va n znc (yngre cnvef birejevgr rneyvre barf). Bayl jura gur znc
vf pbzcyrgr, ybbx hc `gf`, gura `yriry`, jenc rnpu snvyher jvgu `szg.Reebes("gf: %j", ree)`, gura qryrgr gur guerr jryy-xabja xrlf
sebz gur znc naq hfr vg nf `Svryqf`. Sbe `CnefrYriry`: ybjre-pnfr gur vachg bapr naq `fjvgpu` ba
vg; ohvyq gur reebe jvgu `%j` sbe gur fragvary naq `%d` sbe gur vachg. Sbe `Fgevat`: n `fjvgpu`
jvgu n `qrsnhyg` gung sbezngf `vag(y)`.
